{"2248010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Instarion", "steam_appid": 2248010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248010/extras/a5147bfbedb2fbe9b0a62530af1c32f2.avif?t=1786640648\" width=620 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248010/extras/d9dc38a190bb5b06ba9b26124bd90e22.poster.avif?t=1786640648\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248010/extras/d9dc38a190bb5b06ba9b26124bd90e22.webm?t=1786640648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248010/extras/d9dc38a190bb5b06ba9b26124bd90e22.mp4?t=1786640648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive battles everywhere: space, atmospheres, ground, water, underwater.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaceship dogfights, on-foot combat, boarding enemy cruisers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of units — from agile fighters to colossal warships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional co-op for friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for smooth gameplay even on low-end PCs and SteamDeck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2248010/extras/21211794a44b2db5182f01acbe657dac.poster.avif?t=1786640648\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it